.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt RMDIR 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm rmdir
.Nd remove empty directories
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar directory ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility removes each empty
.Ar directory .
A non-empty directory is an error.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mkdir 1 ,
.Xr rm 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
